 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><A NAME="tx798028_1"></A>Note for readers of this English translation </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">This document is an English translation of the consolidated financial statements for the fiscal year ended March&nbsp;31, 2024 (from April&nbsp;1, 2023 to
March&nbsp;31, 2024) prepared in accordance with the Companies Act of Japan. The English translation is not audited and should there be any inconsistency between the translation and the original Japanese text, the original shall prevail.<B> </B>This
document omits certain disclosures required by IFRS<SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">&reg;</SUP> Accounting Standards (&#147;IFRS Accounting Standards&#148;). Full consolidated financial statements for the fiscal year ended
March&nbsp;31, 2024 prepared in accordance with IFRS Accounting Standards will be included in Sony Group Corporation&#146;s annual report on <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Form&nbsp;20-F,</FONT> which Sony Group Corporation expects to file with
the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on or around June&nbsp;25, 2024. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">1 </P>

