<P STYLE="margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Applying IFRS 17 </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">IFRS 17 was
effective for Sony as of April&nbsp;1, 2023. This accounting standard was retrospectively applied and the effect of adopting IFRS 17 on Sony&#146;s total equity as of April&nbsp;1, 2022, the date of transition for IFRS 17, and April&nbsp;1, 2023 was
a decrease of 1,490,667&nbsp;million yen and 631,172&nbsp;million yen, respectively. Refer to Note 2. Material accounting policies (9)&nbsp;Insurance contract liabilities regarding the accounting policy for insurance contracts after the adoption of
IFRS 17. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:15pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
