value in the consolidated statements of financial position whose carrying amounts approximate their fair values mainly due to their short-term nature. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:15pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
