<P STYLE="margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The disclosure is omitted because there are no significant investment properties. </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:15pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
